			<div class="content" id="post-content-454116">
									

<p>Sorry for the reply delay, I've been all over the place the last few days.</p>
<p>Answers to your questions in rapid order:<br />
Personel are Unique by subtitle to allow for upgrading. Also if a card is Unique their can only be 1 copy of it in play whereas each player may only control 1 of each personel….except Bright but that's a special case.</p>
<p>"Rare" cards are 1 per deck Total. So it allows some cards to be very powerful but you can only choose 1 of them and only have 1 in your deck.</p>
<p>The Start of Turn Phases will be streamlined, it's just written out implicitly so that it's clear for playtest. And in regards to needless complication keeping track of 20+ cards and when they came into play is far more paperwork than people stratergising how to activate their abilities to get the best effect.</p>
<p>An all Abilities that say May are optional. You don't have to activate if you don't want to if it's optional.</p>

